  "description": "Dremel 114-Ez402 Ez Lock Mandrel - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Dremel 114-Ez402 Ez Lock Mandrel - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Dremel 114-Ez402 Ez Lock Mandrel - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Make the most of your Dremel rotary tools by using our innovative & extensive line of rotary accessories and attachments. Whatever your project, we’ve got the perfect solution for you. Dremel accessories fit inside your rotary tool to extend it’s versatility. Whether you’re looking to carve, engrave, cut, sand or grind, there is a Dremel accessory to get the job done with pinpoint precision. That’s why our purpose-built Dremel accessories let you get your project right down to the last detail. Dremel accessories are also color-coded into usage categories to make it easier for you to select the right accessory for your project. The Dremel EZ Lock™ makes accessory changes easy as PULL - TWIST - RELEASE. The patented EZ402 Dremel EZ Lock features a one-piece mandrel, designed to simplify the process of changing accessories. The EZ402 mandrel makes accessory changes 6X faster than using a standard mandrel. Compatible with all Dremel rotary tools the EZ402 should only be used with EZ Lock cutting, sanding, cleaning, polishing, grinding and sharpening rotary tool accessories. There’s no need to hunt for the right collet, all Dremel rotary accessories feature a 1/8” standard shank.",
